Funding-Text = {We thank the Galapagos National Park Directorate (GNPD) for their
   continued collaboration, provision of endemic plant seedlings, and
   support in community-based restoration efforts. We acknowledge the
   Biosecurity Agency for the Galapagos (ABG) for their ongoing assistance
