   Chouvenc, Thomas; Brown, Alvin, Univ Florida, Inst Food \& Agr Sci, Ft Lauderdale Res ad Educ Ctr, Entomol \& Nematol Dept, 3205 Coll Ave, Ft Lauderdale, FL 33314 USA.},
