Funding-Acknowledgement = {project FONDECYT {[}1190251]; CEDEUS FONDAP - CONICYT {[}15110020]},
Funding-Text = {This research was sponsored by the project FONDECYT 1190251 and
   supported by CEDEUS FONDAP 15110020 financed by the CONICYT, and it does
   not involve any conflict of interests. The paper analyses wetland
   urbanization as part of recent urban sprawl in one of the cities in the
   Metropolitan area of Concepcion (Chile) , in South America. First, it
   presents a characterization of the urban fabrics with urban variables of
   density, distance, population, dwellings, roads, and green areas
   surrounding a wetland and determines the urban patterns. Second, we
